In real time?
实时破案？

473
00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:10.740
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

474
00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:12.280
It's not missing at all.
它根本没丢。

475
00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:13.640
It's not missing.
它没丢。

476
00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:14.680
You have what you need.
你拥有你需要的一切。

477
00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:16.100
I have everything I need.
我拥有我需要的一切。

478
00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:17.680
And episode ends.
剧集结束。

479
00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:18.240
Credits.
演职员表。

