00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:33.800
He doesn't need all this other Computron and the Segway and the Think Tank.
他根本不需要那些什么Computron、平衡车和智囊团。

484
00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:34.400
Yeah.
没错。

