值得去的地方。

518
00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:11.420
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

519
00:24:11.620 --> 00:24:14.240
And she was like, you must go to dinner with me.
她说，你一定要跟我一起去吃顿晚餐。

520
00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:16.660
There's this amazing restaurant in Tel Aviv.
特拉维夫有家很棒的餐厅。

521
00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:20.860
It's on all the like the best restaurants lists and it's called Mulyam.
它在所有顶级餐厅榜单上都有名，名字叫 Mulyam。

522
00:24:21.240 --> 00:24:24.860
And as it turns out, it was only like a five-minute walk from my hotel.
结果发现，它离我住的酒店只有五分钟的步行路程。

523
00:24:25.700 --> 00:24:27.600
So I was like, oh my gosh, yes.
所以我当时就想，天哪，太好了。

524
00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:29.060
She got us a reservation.
她帮我们订了位子。

525
00:24:29.060 --> 00:24:30.040
I met her there.
我在那里见到了她。

526
00:24:30.420 --> 00:24:32.520
It was one of the best dinners I've ever had.
那是我吃过最棒的晚餐之一。

527
00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:38.000
I actually found video on my phone of my walk there because it was like on this like
我手机里其实还有当时走去餐厅的视频，因为它就在那个

528
00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:39.100
