00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:05.540
I was like, I know.
我说，我知道。

541
00:25:05.700 --> 00:25:06.440
What did we have?
我们到底吃了什么？

542
00:25:06.540 --> 00:25:07.600
She was like, I can't remember.
她说，我不记得了。

543
00:25:08.020 --> 00:25:09.140
I didn't even order.
我甚至都没点菜。

544
00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:10.780
The chef just sent things over.
主厨直接把菜送过来了。

545
00:25:11.180 --> 00:25:11.540
Wow.
哇。

546
00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:20.820
Some of those meals that I've had that are just the best meals I've ever had.
我吃过的一些餐点，真的是我人生中吃过最棒的。

547
00:25:20.940 --> 00:25:21.040
Yeah.
是啊。

548
00:25:21.500 --> 00:25:31.260
I had a bowl of ramen that I got in a train station in Tokyo and I have been chasing that
我在东京的一个火车站吃过一碗拉面，从那以后我就一直在追寻

549
00:25:31.260 --> 00:25:33.440
taste ever since I ate it.
那个味道。

550
00:25:33.640 --> 00:25:38.400
Like I came back to the States and I'm always ordering ramen from restaurants and I cannot
回到美国后，我总是在餐厅点拉面，但怎么也找不到那个味儿

