现在想想都觉得难过。

573
00:26:37.220 --> 00:26:38.860
I have a granola bar in my purse.
我包里有一根燕麦棒。

574
00:26:38.980 --> 00:26:39.720
It's so lame.
太寒酸了。

575
00:26:40.320 --> 00:26:42.900
I want all of the stuff we just talked about.
我想要我们刚才聊的所有那些好吃的。

576
00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:43.600
I do too.
我也是。

577
00:26:43.920 --> 00:26:45.460
Okay, where are we in the banker?
好了，我们讲到《银行家》哪儿了？

578
00:26:45.800 --> 00:26:51.320
Well, where we are is that Michael is going to introduce Eric to Toby.
我们讲到迈克尔要带埃里克去见托比。

579
00:26:52.280 --> 00:26:53.160
Quote, Toby.
引用一下，“托比”。

580
00:26:53.160 --> 00:26:53.940
Exactly.
没错。

581
00:26:54.700 --> 00:26:58.600
It's actually Dwight sitting in Toby's chair.
其实是德怀特坐在托比的椅子上。

582
00:26:58.860 --> 00:27:09.920
And Michael explains that he bought himself some time because he put a copy of Best American Mystery Stories 1999 in Toby's favorite bathroom stall.
迈克尔解释说他为自己争取了一些时间，因为他在托比最喜欢的厕所隔间里放了一本《1999年美国最佳悬疑故事集》。

583
00:27:10.420 --> 00:27:11.600
Well, I was intrigued.
嗯，我被勾起兴趣了。

584
00:27:11.820 --> 00:27:14.220
Is this a real book or is this a made-up book?
这是真书还是编出来的书？

585
00:27:14.860 --> 00:27:17.160
Now, we know that Toby likes mysteries.
我们知道托比喜欢悬疑小说。

586
00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:18.740
That's been established.
这一点已经确定了。

587
00:27:18.740 --> 00:27:22.340
It turns out that this is a real anthology series.
事实证明，这确实是一个真实的选集系列。

588
00:27:22.720 --> 00:27:26.620
The Best American Mystery Anthology series started in 1997.
《美国最佳悬疑选集》系列始于1997年。

589
00:27:27.300 --> 00:27:29.660
It is a collection of essays and short stories.
它是一系列散文和短篇小说的合集。

590
00:27:29.920 --> 00:27:30.980
It would come out annually.
每年都会出版。

591
00:27:31.540 --> 00:27:38.220
I think recently they changed the name to Best American Mystery and Suspense Stories.
我想最近他们把名字改成了《美国最佳悬疑与惊悚故事集》。

592
00:27:38.760 --> 00:27:43.360
But this Best American Anthologies, they go way back.
但这些“美国最佳”系列选集，历史非常悠久。

593
00:27:43.560 --> 00:27:48.080
It started in 1915 and is still published today.
它始于1915年，至今仍在出版。

594
00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:48.820
Wow.
哇。

595
00:27:49.180 --> 00:27:50.780
That is over 100 years.
那都超过100年了。

596
00:27:50.940 --> 00:27:51.600
That's awesome.
太厉害了。

597
00:27:52.160 --> 00:27:58.740
So, in addition to short stories and mystery, there are seven of these serials still in publication.
所以，除了短篇小说和悬疑类，还有七个这样的系列仍在出版中。

598
00:27:58.740 --> 00:28:09.400
They are Best of American Essays, Best American Science and Nature Writing, Best American Travel Writing, Best American Science Fiction and Fantasy.
它们分别是《美国最佳散文》、《美国最佳科学与自然写作》、《美国最佳旅行写作》、《美国最佳科幻与奇幻小说》。

599
00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:11.160
Angela, I thought you might like that.
安吉拉，我想你会喜欢这些的。

600
00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:11.620
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

601
00:28:11.820 --> 00:28:13.780
Might be a future gift you see from me.
这可能是我以后会送你的礼物。

602
00:28:13.840 --> 00:28:14.120
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

603
00:28:14.360 --> 00:28:17.160
And Best American Food Writing.
还有《美国最佳美食写作》。

604
00:28:17.160 --> 00:28:20.540
There are a whole bunch of others that have been discontinued.
还有一大堆其他的系列已经停刊了。

605
00:28:20.640 --> 00:28:22.660
There was a Best American Recipes.
曾经还有过《美国最佳食谱》。

606
00:28:22.960 --> 00:28:23.500
Oh.
哦。

607
00:28:23.960 --> 00:28:25.760
A Best American Spiritual Writing.
《美国最佳灵性写作》。

608
00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:28.860
This one I was really curious about.
这本我真的很好奇。

609
00:28:29.260 --> 00:28:31.640
