关键就在这里。

1213
00:57:23.660 --> 00:57:25.240
You're so happy to be doing that.
你非常乐于做这件事。

1214
00:57:25.360 --> 00:57:30.520
But you definitely miss, like, adult conversation and seeing people.
但你肯定会怀念成年人之间的对话和社交。

1215
00:57:30.760 --> 00:57:35.380
But yet, your heart and everything that you want to be doing is right there at home.
然而，你的心和你真正想做的一切都系在家里。

1216
00:57:35.380 --> 00:57:44.720
